          "heading": "Fiji players knelt to shake Michael D Higgins' hand at the Aviva",
          "body": "Ahead of tonight's Aviva Stadium meeting, Balls.ie looks back at the 2024 fixture, when Fiji's players knelt one by one to shake President Michael D Higgins' hand before kick-off. Virgin Media pundit Matt Williams, on duty that day, explained the gesture: \"This is the respect of the Malenesian people.\" Higgins attended that game as his last autumn international at the stadium. Fiji arrive without a point from four Nations Championship games."
