          "kicker": "Captain's warning",
          "heading": "Maro Itoje warns England against sleepwalking into Japan clash at Twickenham",
          "body": "England captain Maro Itoje has warned his side they cannot afford to sleepwalk into Saturday's clash with Japan, insisting they \"need to be alive\" to whatever Japan throw at them. Itoje, who made his debut under Japan head coach Eddie Jones in 2016, when Jones was England coach, said Japan are \"very consistent at getting speed into the game\", and that England's answer is to \"impose our game\". England have never lost to Japan and have scored 50 or more points in each of their last two meetings."
        },
