          "kicker": "U20 result",
          "heading": "France U20 lose 27-19 to Italy in Parma despite late pressure",
          "body": "France U20, captained by Clément Paul, opened their year in Parma by falling 17-0 behind and going down to 13 men by the 21st minute. Tries from Tyreese Robin and Xan Mariluz before the break cut the gap to 22-14, and the side pushed for the final 40 minutes but could not turn that into victory. France U20 coach Cédric Laborde said there was still plenty of work to do, pointing to imprecision and too many infringements."
        },
