          "kicker": "Off-field visit",
          "heading": "Italy players and Gonzalo Quesada pose at Genoa shelter for adoption campaign",
          "body": "Italy's players joined head coach Gonzalo Quesada at the Monte Contessa municipal shelter in Genoa, posing with some of the animals in its care during the Captain's Run on the eve of Saturday's Nations Championship test against Argentina at Stadio Luigi Ferraris. The visit backed the 'Adopt, don't buy' campaign, alongside Genoa councillor Francesca Ghio and shelter volunteers. The Federazione Italiana Rugby said it sees the national team's presence as a way to give visibility to causes of value to the wider community."
