          "heading": "Pablo Matera captains Pumas against Italy with Montoya sidelined by injury",
          "body": "The Pumas' leadership passes to Matera with Montoya ruled out, and the captain says the bench sends a message. Six forwards and two backs, he says, means the game will be decided up front, in the set pieces. He describes an experienced pack, with forward Guido Petti and Matera himself having played many matches, and says Pedro Rubiolo has played whenever available for three years. Looking back at the 42-12 defeat to Ireland, he said the first step had been self-criticism."
