          "body": "Suaalii, the rugby league convert, switches from the left wing to the centre for Sunday's Nations Championship clash against Scotland at Murrayfield, replacing Isaac Henry. He started last week's defeat to England at Twickenham on the left wing, and now lines up alongside Len Ikitau at No 12, with Harry Potter moving to No 11. The Wallabies are already out of contention for the inaugural Nations Championship final, having lost three of their four matches."
